 worth the Legend investment, and so on?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mysteries of the World got you covered.<br /> <br /> I would say, personally, that if you ask the question when designing powers: &quot;Would people always take this power all things being equal?&quot; If the answer is yes, it is too powerful, and limits can help balance it. Limits being: spending Legend instead of imbuing when activating, shortening the duration, and put target/usage limits.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}